d":"marker51","name":"Scorchstal Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Ulilfanatism."},{"id":"marker52","name":"Drunul Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Yotunn (Giants) Spirits."},{"id":"marker53","name":"Grurdin Leopards","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker54","name":"Aneksurgek Crows","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Bral Lions","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Chug Wolfs","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Narud Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡑᠩᡯᢥᡰᢁᡳᡔᡳᠮᡟᡀᡜᠱᡕᡝᠾᢠᠲ᠑ᠧᠮᠿᡏᢒᡁᡀ᠒᠒ᠿᢁ᠒ᠵᡔᡝᢜᡕᡱᡡᠪᠠᠦᡗᠡᢂᠲᠳᡀᡓᡞᢤᡴᢢᢡᠽᡗᡐᢥᠠᡝᡮᡍᡱ᠑ᡐ</div>"},{"id":"marker63","name":"Dodgez Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༩༹ༀ༖༗༖༙༘༆༤༓༛༾༭༸༂༁༃༲༔༁༢༠༄༾༐༑༪༜༬༮༺༩༄༆༂༪༼༹༠༗༰༾༭༌༨༆༛༽༡</div>"},{"id":"marker64","name":"Dirdrel Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༭༐༶༾༪༈༊༗༳༬༠༺༪༲༔༫༪༊༉༤༦༊༄༷༁༔༭༶༠༨༣༥༁༬༦༖༗༹༭༿༄༰༺༭༖</div>"},{"id":"marker65","name":"Cagen Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">የተ አዐፈዘበ ጰየወበነወሰፀቀዐረፀሰሀ ጰተዘከጰደሠወ ረደሀበሐለለመዘፐወፀጠሰተመሠደ በነየ በሐነዐቀተፀወፈ</div>"},{"id":"marker66","name":"Tengri Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዐከደወአነዘነተተ ሰገበጰመጰአ አፐበቀሐተረበሀመየ ዐረሰሠሐዘ ጸ ጠጰነፀኀ  ለፐሠጠዘፈገከየወ   መደፈቀወረበፐ </div>"},{"id":"marker67","name":"Khuldzod Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳢⳂ⳹ ⲾⳠ⳥ⳁ ⲶⲸⲾⳖⲶⳎⳁⳄⲼⳔⳄⳜⲸⳖⲺⳀⳤⳐⳠ ⳩ ⳐⲶ⳹ⳌⳠⳌⳎⳐ⳹ⳔⳁⳔⳜ ⳩ⳘⳐⳆⳌⲾ⳩ⳚⲴⲸⲺⳞⲶⳒⲴⳎ ⳃⳎⳫⳊⳞⲴⲺ Ⳗ⳥ⳜⳤⳢ ⳔⲶⳖⳬⲴⳜ</div>"},{"id":"marker68","name":"Ar'thaz Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠱\udc19\udc22\udc20\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc02\ud802 \udc10\udc29𐠝\udc17\udc2e\udc3f 𐠷\ud802𐠋𐠳\ud802𐠩𐠖\udc26\udc08𐠂\ud802 𐠌\udc35\udc24\ud802𐠴\udc11\udc3c𐠚\ud802𐠬\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker69","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker70","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker71","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker72","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker73","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker74","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Vucrad Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Korkraz Melee","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of cunning in Korkraz, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Lulkon Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Lulkon, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Kogrugh River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Deer migration","legend":"A huge group of deer are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Hawks migration","legend":"A huge group of hawks are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Goats migration","legend":"A huge group of goats are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Ghedg gala","legend":"A gala has been organised at Ghedg as a chance to gather the spiritual leaders of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Perculiar mirage","legend":"This perculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"i